      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استوكث</span></b>  <i>He ate of what is called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وكاث</span>:
(K:) <i>he hastened, and ate somewhat of that
which is called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وكاث</span>, <i>thereby to attain the
period of the morning-meal called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الغَدَآء</span>. (L.)

